    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DECIET, DUELS AND DEDUCTION</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fingie Bandits</strong> is a brand new\u00a0<strong>social deduction</strong> experience for 4<strong>\u00a0- 8 players.</strong>\u00a0Play with your friends or hop into an online lobby and be ready for a rootin'-tootin ordeal of lies and betrayal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WHAT IN TARNATION?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, communication is key. Players must rely on deduction and proximity voice-chat in order to sus out who's an innocent cowboy, and who's a traitorous bandit out for blood. In order for the cowboys to win, the bandit team must all be identified and successfully voted out before they can outnumber our heroic frontiersmen. If that weren't enough chaos for your liking, on top of that get ready for\u00a0<strong>gunslinging duels</strong> and <strong>additional roles </strong>(Sheriff, Nuke, Trickster...), which<strong>\u00a0</strong>should leave you with hours of fun and  enough deceit and betrayal to ruin every friendship you have...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YEEHAW!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DECIET, DUELS AND DEDUCTION</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fingie Bandits</strong> is a brand new\u00a0<strong>social deduction</strong> experience for 4<strong>\u00a0- 8 players.</strong>\u00a0Play with your friends or hop into an online lobby and be ready for a rootin'-tootin ordeal of lies and betrayal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WHAT IN TARNATION?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, communication is key. Players must rely on deduction and proximity voice-chat in order to sus out who's an innocent cowboy, and who's a traitorous bandit out for blood. In order for the cowboys to win, the bandit team must all be identified and successfully voted out before they can outnumber our heroic frontiersmen. If that weren't enough chaos for your liking, on top of that get ready for\u00a0<strong>gunslinging duels</strong> and <strong>additional roles </strong>(Sheriff, Nuke, Trickster...), which<strong>\u00a0</strong>should leave you with hours of fun and  enough deceit and betrayal to ruin every friendship you have...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YEEHAW!</strong></p>",
